  "interpretation": [
    "Fixture matrices are correctness coverage, not every possible account/OS/permission branch.",
    "The extended suite launches two fresh loopback servers/databases and its own in-process SMTP sink. No real account or mailbox is used.",
    "At-rest ciphertext checks and encrypted-data preservation are real server/database assertions, not screenshots.",
    "The first final route invocation hit its 240-second harness timeout; the separately recorded complete 200-capture run passed.",
    "An initial local run raced the pending-state render; its assertion now waits for the observed disabled control while the request remains held. Only the successful complete rerun is counted.",
    "The quick suite and three-sample final profile ran without competing browser/build workloads.",
    "Profile cold-task ranges overlap the baseline; no meaningful dialog speedup is claimed.",
    "Native device, IME/Back, accessibility services, biometrics, WebView behavior, system palettes and physical frame/battery measurements remain excluded."
  ],
